    In this paper, we will generalize partial difference sets derived from cyclotomy. For a
more detailed decription of cyclotomic classes in finite fields, see for example Storer [15].
Let q = pr = αf + 1 for a prime p, and further let ω be a primitive element in Fq . Then
the αth cyclotomic classes C0 , C1 , . . . , Cα−1 are given by:

