+## Three-line summary
+
+Jedwab–Li: the specified \(\mathbb Z_{27}^2\) block and, more generally, the fixed realization above for \(a\ge3\), are not subgroup unions even after adjoining 0; 13 subgroup differences suffice in the checked case.  
+Polhill: the regular positive ingredients are unions of full punctured subgroups and subgroup shells, and fail subgroup-union closure under multiplication by \(p\).  
